# RIMSHIRE: a battle at a home is fought in the home's own arena, not on the
# tiles round it: a yard with a gatehouse on each long wall and a camp of
# tents and huts; a castle has stone floors and a bastion in every corner.
# The castle falls with its army.
game rimshire
cheat war 1
cheat cpu 1 -1
# the Plum home of THE LONG LANE, a plain home (lakes nowhere near)
cheat battle 12 1 0
expect walls == 6
expect water_cells == 0
expect floor_cells == 0
expect props > 0
# war 5: the Plum home is a castle
cheat war 5
cheat cpu 1 -1
expect castle1 == 1
expect castle0 == 0
cheat battle 13 3 0
expect walls == 10
expect water_cells == 0
expect floor_cells > 100
expect cell_0_0 == 1
